      <lg n="53" met="indravajrā">
<l n="a"><lb n="N41"/><milestone unit="column" n="a"/><g ref="sym:circle-bullseye" type="punctuation">.</g>yaś cāri-varggaś ca samīkṣya lokai<milestone unit="column" n="b" break="no"/>r</l>
<l n="b">uktāv ubhau candramasā samānau</l>
<l n="c"><lb n="N42"/><milestone unit="column" n="a"/>Ekas samas tena tu śukla-pakṣe</l>
<l n="d"><milestone unit="column" n="b"/>kr̥ṣṇe dvitīyas sa tayor viśeṣaḥ</l>
