<l n="b">yathaiva vaiyākaraṇair vviśeṣyam</l>
<l n="c"><lb n="N44"/><milestone unit="column" n="a"/>Uktaṁ yathā yasya tathā prajābhi<milestone unit="column" n="b" break="no"/>r</l>
