<l n="c"><lb n="N53"/>bhinnātmā śatadhā dadhāti bhagavān rudro bhidā-śaṅkayā</l>
<l n="d"><lb n="N54"/>pūrvvaṁ śaśvad asaṅśayo ’dhivasati svasthas tu rudraḥ parām</l>
</lg>
      <lg n="59" met="vasantatilakā">
